# GitHub load / commit / draft

- Load files with `loadJsonFile` / `loadFile` (Contents API).
- Push changes only through `commitJsonFiles` (Git Data: blobs → tree → one commit → update ref). Never one commit per file.
- Commit message should list modified locale codes only (schema-only configs may use the schema message).
- Persist working state with `saveDraft` / `loadDraftAsync` (IndexedDB primary, localStorage mirror); key is owner/repo/sourceBranch (not langs).
- After successful commit or Load from GitHub, keep shas + originals in sync so “modified” filters stay correct.
